Package: cosmic-ext-island
Version: @version@
Architecture: @arch@
Maintainer: Jiří Čepelka <jirkacepelka@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @size@
Depends: @depends@, cosmic-panel
Recommends: pulseaudio-utils
Suggests: gnome-online-accounts, gnome-control-center, kdeconnect
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Nieuport-Labs/Cosmic-notch
Description: Dynamic Island for the COSMIC desktop
 An island over the top panel of COSMIC that shows the date, the time and
 what is playing. Pointed at, it opens into a system overview, media controls
 with synced lyrics, a shelf for files, a calendar and a to-do list that can
 sync with Google Tasks. It follows the COSMIC theme.
 .
 pulseaudio-utils provides parec, which the bars next to the playing track
 read the sound from.
